I add a new build flag to trigger all page filters. Please use this flag in your code because our filter feature is still unstable.

For example:
```ts
const NewComponent = () => {
  if (config.enableAllPageFilter) {
    return null; // no render
  }
  return <div>Feature</div>
}
```

